tta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T21:38:08-08:00","id":1528301,"title":"","content":"Does this incorporate ideas and canon found in Dark Alliance: Vancouver, or is it entirely new?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T21:51:19-08:00","id":1528302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528210-rage-across-vancouver?p=1528301#post1528301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does this incorporate ideas and canon found in Dark Alliance: Vancouver, or is it entirely new?</div> </div> </div> </div>It does not. The thread name is a bit of a typo; this does not use material for from this book or involve the city of Vancouver. It is specifically for Vancouver Island, which according to Dark Alliance: Vancouver doesn't have any sort of activity or even society on it whatsoever. Which obviously isn't true in real life :P<br /> <br /> Also, thank you, everyone! Appreciate the support &lt;3","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T18:56:14-08:00","id":1528347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gh0st-fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528210-rage-across-vancouver?p=1528302#post1528302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It does not. The thread name is a bit of a typo; this does not use material for from this book or involve the city of Vancouver. It is specifically for Vancouver Island, which according to Dark Alliance: Vancouver doesn't have any sort of activity or even society on it whatsoever. Which obviously isn't true in real life :P<br /> <br /> Also, thank you, everyone! Appreciate the support &lt;3</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, Dark Alliance has one plot thread related to Vancouver Island. It posits the existence of a vague bad Something in Victoria that is blamed for causing vampires to disappear (including a few of Siegfried's lieutenants) and Garou that make it back to look like they had the life sapped out of them. It's only briefly mentioned a couple of times in passing in the book, a background detail more than anything else.<br /> <br /> I dunno if it ever regarded Vancouver Island as being lacking in any society or such either.I think there's brief mentions of Garou Septs on the Island. It just focused very hard on Vancouver specifically (even the suburbs and wider metro area get treated like they don't really exist, frankly).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T19:42:33-08:00","id":1528348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kharnov</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528210-rage-across-vancouver?p=1528347#post1528347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually, Dark Alliance has one plot thread related to Vancouver Island. It posits the existence of a vague bad Something in Victoria that is blamed for causing vampires to disappear (including a few of Siegfried's lieutenants) and Garou that make it back to look like they had the life sapped out of them. It's only briefly mentioned a couple of times in passing in the book, a background detail more than anything else.<br /> <br /> I dunno if it ever regarded Vancouver Island as being lacking in any society or such either.I think there's brief mentions of Garou Septs on the Island. It just focused very hard on Vancouver specifically (even the suburbs and wider metro area get treated like they don't really exist, frankly).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's fair. I was being a bit facetious with my statement, but my point was Vancouver Island is underplayed by the book. Understandable, as it largely focuses on Vancouver the city, but we felt like there was a lot of room to expand, and the information in general to be pretty outdated. The only mention of Vancouver the city in our book is a reference to a sept called City of Glass.<br /> <br /> With that said though, if anyone would like to use material from Dark Alliance alongside this, feel free to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}